<title>FRANCE: Delivery sought on Feb rapeseed positions - MATIF.</title>
<headline>Delivery sought on Feb rapeseed positions - MATIF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operators sought physical delivery on all 955 positions left outstanding on the now expired February rapeseed contract, a spokeswoman for the French futures exchange MATIF said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The contract expired on January 31.</p>
<p>The lots translate into 47,750 tonnes of rapeseed on the physical market.</p>
<p>Physical delivery was requested to the ports of Metz and Frouard on the Moselle river in France, she said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
